top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E5%8D%A1%E5%B0%BC%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"卡卡尼亚\"><img alt=\"卡卡尼亚\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E5%8D%A1%E5%B0%BC%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"卡卡尼亚\">卡卡尼亚</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：308004</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3080/308004/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">高塔是什么时候筑成的？<br />她登上台阶时，已无暇思考这个问题。她的确曾得到过失败的预兆，但在这一刻，她只看到了塔顶的火光，以及遍野的哀嚎——这个时代已经病得太久，急需一把手术刀来清除这些腐烂的疮痈。<br />于是，她一步一步登得更高，也看得更远，看得到更多亟待被拯救的心灵。皮囊之下的思维，思维之中的潜意识；每一缕思绪，都是一条引向幽微的道路。她沿着道路向前，向前……向前。直到忘却了应当如何折返。<br />无路可走之时，她终于想起了最初的预兆。试图拯救他人，从来都是一种自负。那看顾一个时代的代价，想必她已知晓。<br />但她早已决定承付这必然的代价，即使要从塔顶跃下。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"308004\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308007.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f7/Belonging-308007.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“金心之于镜影”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Heart of Mirrored Gold\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />100<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>已然有些模糊的铜质手镜，让人怀疑是否能显现事物清晰的倒影。<br />受访者多次悉心指出，相较于外在的现象，内在的本质更需要被关注。或许使自我之倒影更清晰就是该职业的责任所在。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cb/Belonging-308008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">医生的小玩意儿<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Good Doctor's Tools</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />16<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>细链穿起的随身工具，由药膏盒、剪刀、钥匙、探针等组成。由于高低错落的缘故，行走时也不会发出叮叮当当的响声。<br />好事的采访者们没有在其中发现任何稀奇的道具。在经历过足够多的采访后我明白，最伟大的施救者所依赖的只有自己那一往无前的决心。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308009.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9f/Belonging-308009.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“剖者”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Surgeon of the Mind\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一个并不常见的纹样，只有仔细辨认才能看出，那是阿斯克勒庇俄斯之蛇缠绕在无框的窗架上。<br />任何人都无法真正走进另一个人的心房，医生只是尽可能透过那窗子，引导闭室中的人自己走出来，受访者解答时透露出明显的无奈与悲伤。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A41.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 时代病陪护1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A41.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A41.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A41.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A41.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A41.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A41.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A42.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 时代病陪护2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A42.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A42.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A42.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A42.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A42.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A42.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">时代病陪护 <small style=\"color: grey\">Guardian of the Broken</small></span></span>"}}